cellVdec/cellAdec: cellVdecQueryAttrEx, cellVdecOpenEx, cellAdecOpenEx.

Symptom: Killzone 2 (1.29) hangs when its intro movie starts (intro/introfmvmov.jsp, MOVIES/GameIntro_PS3.avi):
"[hle] unresolved NID 0xC982A84A / 0x0053E2D8 / 0x8B5551A4", then StartSeq(handle=0) for both decoders, two 2 MB
reads of the file and no DecodeAu; flips stop and the last menu frame stays on screen.
Cause: the movie player opens its decoders through the Ex forms, which were not implemented; the HLE default
returned 0 without writing the attr or the handle. Fix: the Ex forms forward to QueryAttr/Open (the Ex type and
resource structs keep the leading codecType and the same four-argument layout; the stub ignores the resource).

Verification: Killzone 2 under Proton. Upstream candidate (general).
v0.17.0 rebase (ps3recomp a6d76c8): 6013 Vdec half dropped (upstream #379, same forwarders); cellAdecOpenEx half kept.

diff --git a/libs/codec/cellAdec.c b/libs/codec/cellAdec.c
index 9bacce2..0cd5d76 100644
--- a/libs/codec/cellAdec.c
+++ b/libs/codec/cellAdec.c
@@ -173,6 +173,16 @@ s32 cellAdecOpen(const CellAdecType* type, const CellAdecResource* res,
     return (s32)CELL_ADEC_ERROR_BUSY;
 }
 
+/* KZ2 patch 6013: cellAdecOpenEx (NID 0x8B5551A4), used by Killzone 2's movie
+ * player next to cellVdecOpenEx. CellAdecResourceEx only adds SPURS/PPU
+ * placement fields this stub ignores; forward to cellAdecOpen. */
+s32 cellAdecOpenEx(const CellAdecType* type, const void* resEx,
+                   const CellAdecCb* cb, CellAdecHandle* handle)
+{
+    printf("[cellAdec] OpenEx -> Open\n");
+    return cellAdecOpen(type, (const CellAdecResource*)resEx, cb, handle);
+}
+
 s32 cellAdecClose(CellAdecHandle handle)
 {
     printf("[cellAdec] Close(handle=%u)\n", handle);
diff --git a/libs/codec/cellAdec.h b/libs/codec/cellAdec.h
index 2282b24..e19cbbb 100644
--- a/libs/codec/cellAdec.h
+++ b/libs/codec/cellAdec.h
@@ -124,6 +124,9 @@ s32 cellAdecQueryAttr(const CellAdecType* type, void* attr);
 s32 cellAdecOpen(const CellAdecType* type, const CellAdecResource* res,
                  const CellAdecCb* cb, CellAdecHandle* handle);
 s32 cellAdecClose(CellAdecHandle handle);
+/* KZ2 patch 6013: Ex form (CellAdecResourceEx), same argument layout. */
+s32 cellAdecOpenEx(const CellAdecType* type, const void* resEx,
+                   const CellAdecCb* cb, CellAdecHandle* handle);
 
 s32 cellAdecStartSeq(CellAdecHandle handle, void* param);
 s32 cellAdecEndSeq(CellAdecHandle handle);
